{"id":"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFvw==","name":"Slimeling","description":"The Slimeling is a utility mob that spawns from Slimeling Eggs found on the surface of Mars. It shares some features from vanilla wolves and mules: it can be tamed and attacks mobs that threaten its owners, and can be equipped with a special chest to transport items.\n\nAs an allied mob, Slimelings will actively help and follow the player-owner and will attempt to protect them. They can also have a neutral behavior, that is, they can attack if provoked or hurt by non-owners.\n\nItems that you can feed Slimelings with:\n\nBoat\nCooked fish\nGunpowder\nGold ingot\nRedstone repeater\nWooden door\n\nSlimelings can be equipped by their owners with a Slimeling Inventory Bag to transport items.\n\nTo complete this quest get any one of the eggs - note you may need a Heavy Duty Pickaxe.","icon":{"Count":1,"Damage":2,"OreDict":"","id":"GalacticraftMars:tile.slimelingEgg","resolved":null,"label":"Unknown item (GalacticraftMars:tile.slimelingEgg, metadata 2)"},"prerequisites":["AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAFlQ=="],"tasks":{"0":{"autoConsume":0,"consume":0,"groupDetect":0,"ignoreNBT":1,"index":0,"partialMatch":1,"requireOnlyOneItem":1,"requiredItems":{"0":{"Count":1,"Damage":0,"OreDict":"","id":"GalacticraftMars:tile.slimelingEgg","resolved":null,"label":"Unknown item (GalacticraftMars:tile.slimelingEgg, metadata 0)"},"1":{"Count":1,"Damage":1,"OreDict":"","id":"GalacticraftMars:tile.slimelingEgg","resolved":null,"label":"Unknown item (GalacticraftMars:tile.slimelingEgg, metadata 1)"},"2":{"Count":1,"Damage":2,"OreDict":"","id":"GalacticraftMars:tile.slimelingEgg","resolved":null,"label":"Unknown item (GalacticraftMars:tile.slimelingEgg, metadata 2)"}},"taskID":"bq_standard:retrieval"}},"rewards":{"0":{"choices":{"0":{"Count":1,"Damage":4,"OreDict":"","id":"GalacticraftMars:item.null","resolved":{"id":"i:GalacticraftMars:item.null:4","name":"Slimeling Inventory Bag","mod":"GalacticraftMars","registry":"item.null","icon":77